1
00:00:03,642 --> 00:00:04,767
Still not enough clues.

2
00:00:10,375 --> 00:00:12,490
What part is Xu playing in all this?

3
00:00:38,900 --> 00:00:39,975
You're early.

4
00:00:40,500 --> 00:00:41,350
No drink yet?

5
00:00:42,200 --> 00:00:43,175
Excuse me!

6
00:00:44,532 --> 00:00:46,250
We need to end this affair.

7
00:00:48,364 --> 00:00:49,567
Why?

8
00:00:51,121 --> 00:00:52,421
Li Weishi is a good man.

9
00:00:52,421 --> 00:00:54,421
I want to settle down with him.

10
00:01:02,429 --> 00:01:04,429
Bored with me already?

11
00:01:05,373 --> 00:01:07,373
Just don't contact me again.

12
00:01:26,143 --> 00:01:26,943
Excuse me!

13
00:01:27,151 --> 00:01:27,926
A coffee, please.

14
00:01:36,481 --> 00:01:38,031
Who was that woman?

15
00:01:38,756 --> 00:01:39,529
Why are you here?

16
00:01:40,168 --> 00:01:40,808
Answer me.

17
00:01:40,808 --> 00:01:41,672
Who was she?

18
00:01:43,108 --> 00:01:43,858
Oh...

19
00:01:43,873 --> 00:01:45,373
Just someone from work.

20
00:01:45,373 --> 00:01:46,418
Sit down. Have a drink.

21
00:01:47,642 --> 00:01:48,522
Xu Yan.

22
00:01:48,873 --> 00:01:50,425
Do you think I'm an idiot?

23
00:01:51,642 --> 00:01:53,142
Listen to me. Please.

24
00:01:53,290 --> 00:01:54,040
Let go!

25
00:01:54,650 --> 00:01:56,100
We're through.

26
00:01:56,334 --> 00:01:57,698
I never want to see you again.

27
00:01:57,836 --> 00:01:58,393
Xiaodie!

28
00:01:58,393 --> 00:01:59,168
Xiaodie!

29
00:02:04,507 --> 00:02:05,287
Wait here a moment.

30
00:02:05,287 --> 00:02:06,437
I need the bathroom.

31
00:02:06,437 --> 00:02:07,187
Okay.

32
00:02:35,945 --> 00:02:37,191
Hello, Xiaodie?

33
00:02:37,759 --> 00:02:38,684
Listen to me.

34
00:02:38,989 --> 00:02:40,989
I've only met that girl twice.

35
00:02:42,435 --> 00:02:43,285
Hello?

36
00:02:44,015 --> 00:02:44,765
Xiaodie?

37
00:02:48,056 --> 00:02:50,056
I can't lose Xiaodie like this.

38
00:02:50,893 --> 00:02:51,793
I have to act.

39
00:03:03,924 --> 00:03:05,877
I won't let you leave me.

40
00:04:14,867 --> 00:04:15,817
I don't believe it.

41
00:04:16,450 --> 00:04:17,314
I don't believe it.

42
00:04:32,299 --> 00:04:33,049
So...

43
00:04:33,515 --> 00:04:35,819
someone else has to pay for the loop

44
00:04:36,191 --> 00:04:38,191
for me to get what I want.

45
00:04:54,080 --> 00:04:54,830
Hello?

46
00:04:54,831 --> 00:04:56,106
Mr Gao.

47
00:04:57,279 --> 00:04:58,550
Could you do me a favour?

48
00:05:01,476 --> 00:05:02,626
Could you get

49
00:05:02,626 --> 00:05:03,508
a friend of mine

50
00:05:03,508 --> 00:05:05,508
into Meikang Care Home?

51
00:05:06,645 --> 00:05:07,690
Her name is Lin Jianhe.

52
00:05:09,374 --> 00:05:10,349
Yes.

53
00:05:10,349 --> 00:05:11,299
That's right.

54
00:05:13,267 --> 00:05:14,142
Thank you so much.

55
00:05:15,543 --> 00:05:16,293
All right.

56
00:05:16,620 --> 00:05:17,245
Oh,

57
00:05:17,245 --> 00:05:18,095
don't mention me.

58
00:05:18,095 --> 00:05:19,126
Don't mention me.

59
00:05:30,078 --> 00:05:31,444
He hasn't woken up yet.

60
00:05:32,340 --> 00:05:34,580
We have to wait until he wakes up

61
00:05:34,580 --> 00:05:35,363
and find out

62
00:05:35,363 --> 00:05:38,051
what he knows about Tesla's pocket watch.

63
00:05:39,417 --> 00:05:40,223
Okay.

64
00:05:42,709 --> 00:05:44,709
Or we could wait for you to get here.

65
00:06:00,447 --> 00:06:01,811
You're me from two days ahead?

66
00:06:02,620 --> 00:06:03,984
I'm you from three days ahead.

67
00:06:05,551 --> 00:06:06,536
Where's today's me?

68
00:06:06,808 --> 00:06:08,353
He's inside waiting for Li Weishi.

69
00:06:12,385 --> 00:06:13,735
You have one more chance.

70
00:06:14,244 --> 00:06:15,494
Stay with Lin Jianhe.

71
00:06:16,058 --> 00:06:17,283
Let Zhao Yidie go.

72
00:06:21,610 --> 00:06:22,735
Weishi?

73
00:06:23,717 --> 00:06:24,767
Let me introduce you.

74
00:06:25,255 --> 00:06:26,210
This is my colleague,

75
00:06:26,606 --> 00:06:27,381
Li Weishi.

76
00:06:27,603 --> 00:06:28,153
Hello.

77
00:06:28,153 --> 00:06:29,339
And this is my fiancée,

78
00:06:30,190 --> 00:06:30,940
Zhao Yidie.

79
00:06:33,303 --> 00:06:34,053
Xu...

80
00:06:35,856 --> 00:06:37,856
Maybe we're fated to repeat this loop.

81
00:06:41,522 --> 00:06:42,632
You know, I've noticed

82
00:06:42,632 --> 00:06:43,882
you're short-sighted too.

83
00:06:44,501 --> 00:06:45,865
You'll see clearly eventually.

84
00:06:50,347 --> 00:06:51,894
Your colleague's so strange.

85
00:06:51,894 --> 00:06:53,144
Why's he staring at me?

86
00:06:54,311 --> 00:06:55,136
Don't mind him.

